WEBVTT

00:03:59.454 --> 00:04:02.579
But now we know— 
when A made his first statement,

00:04:02.579 --> 00:04:05.663
he must have been holding
either 5 or 6.

00:04:05.996 --> 00:04:08.954
B has access to the same information 
we do,

00:04:08.954 --> 00:04:10.454
so he knows this too.

00:04:10.704 --> 00:04:13.621
Let’s review what’s in each
brain at this point:

00:04:13.788 --> 00:04:17.996
everyone knows a lot about the sum,
but only B knows the product.

00:04:18.621 --> 00:04:21.454
Now let’s look at the first part 
of B’s statement.

00:04:21.663 --> 00:04:23.538
What if A’s number was 5?

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:26.788
That could be from 1+4 or 2+3,

00:04:26.788 --> 00:04:30.163
in which case B would have
either 4 or 6.